{"id":"n64618-1-9","stage":4,"title":"수완 · 能力","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64618-1-9-1","ko":"승규는 이번에도 사업에 큰 성공을 했다더라?","zh":"听说承奎这次的业务又取得了巨大成功啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규는","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"승규는","audio":"/audio/8cca37774e5e7081db86.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규는","audio":"/audio/8cca37774e5e7081db86.mp3"}},{"text":"이번에도","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번에도","audio":"/audio/e2060874008b97dfe97b.mp3"}},{"text":"사업에","meaning":"事业，生意","explanation":"사업：事业，生意；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"사업","audio":"/audio/7b3733aab2fd0dcf59d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62048","senseId":"1","lemma":"사업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사업에","audio":"/audio/57c708bf78cbff8e3d45.mp3"}},{"text":"큰","meaning":"重，重大，严重","explanation":"크다：重，重大，严重；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"3","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"큰","audio":"/audio/697674905873e8eb4c58.mp3"}},{"text":"성공을","meaning":"成功","explanation":"성공：成功；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"성공","audio":"/audio/b4f76a33b89bb9474281.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65100","senseId":"1","lemma":"성공","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"성공을","audio":"/audio/4e11d062a574746c8a9e.mp3"}},{"text":"했다더라?","meaning":"获得，取得","explanation":"하다：获得，取得；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다더라：把以前听说的情况告诉对方，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"8","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했다더라","audio":"/audio/a53d42022b3f4e70d0b3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"7b3733aab2fd0dcf","term":"사업","zh":"事业，生意","audio":"/audio/7b3733aab2fd0dcf59d4.mp3","entryId":"62048","definition":"为取得经济利益而经营某种组织。","pronunciation":["사ː업"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"重，重大，严重","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"某事的规模、范围、程度、力量等都超过了一般水平。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"b4f76a33b89bb947","term":"성공","zh":"成功","audio":"/audio/b4f76a33b89bb9474281.mp3","entryId":"65100","definition":"实现愿望或目标。","pronunciation":["성공"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"获得，取得","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"实现某种结果。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3c00d6d24a5f26a8574f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64618-1-9-2","ko":"승규가 워낙에 사업 수완이 좋잖아.","zh":"承奎的经商手腕本来就非常出色啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규가","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}},{"text":"워낙에","meaning":"本来就、非常","explanation":"워낙에：本来就、非常","readings":[{"term":"워낙에","audio":"/audio/99fdc073c92e74259707.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:워낙에:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"워낙에","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"워낙에","audio":"/audio/99fdc073c92e74259707.mp3"}},{"text":"사업","meaning":"事业，生意","explanation":"사업：事业，生意","readings":[{"term":"사업","audio":"/audio/7b3733aab2fd0dcf59d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62048","senseId":"1","lemma":"사업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사업","audio":"/audio/7b3733aab2fd0dcf59d4.mp3"}},{"text":"수완이","meaning":"能力，手腕","ex